OL,3,A'He was our hero,' says family of
OL,4,Apolice officer killed in car crash near
OL,5,AMiddlesbrough
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe family of PC Tom Clough, one of two
OL,8,FCleveland Police officers killed in a
OL,9,Fcar crash on the A66 near Middlesbrough
OL,10,Fon Saturday, has described him as "our
OL,11,Fhero"
OL,13,FPC Matthew Blades was also killed in
OL,14,Fthe collision, Cleveland Police says a
OL,15,Ftribute to him will be "available at a
OL,16,Flater time"
OL,18,FEarlier, the force also named the five
OL,19,Foccupants of a Volkswagen Passat
OL,20,Finvolved in the incident
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
