OL,3,AZelensky should be asked what he knew
OL,4,Aabout government corruption, sacked
OL,5,Aminister tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,8,Fshould be asked questions about
OL,9,Fcorruption in his government, his
OL,10,Fsacked defence minister Mykhailo
OL,11,FFedorov has told the BBC.
OL,13,FFedorov, a popular minister who
OL,14,Fmodernised the military and pioneered
OL,15,Fdrone warfare, was fired last month
OL,16,Fafter reportedly falling out with the
OL,17,Fhead of Ukraine's armed forces.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
